<title>UK: DePfa sets 100 million mark structured bond.</title>
<headline>DePfa sets 100 million mark structured bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following constant maturity swap bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan, Frankfurt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *5.0	 MATURITY    04.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 **	  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE    04.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K)  ONE</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   2.25</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS THEN 85 PCT OF THE 10 YEAR</p>
<p>		 SWAP RATE WITH A MINIMUM OF 5.0 PCT AND A CAP OF</p>
<p>		 7.75 PCT</p>
<p>	     **CONSTANT MATURITY SWAP BOND</p>
<p>		 PFANDBRIEF SERIES 439</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
